# Local run artefacts — machine state, not source.
#
# Each of these was found untracked in a working copy and would have been
# committed by a blanket `git add .`:
#   .elconv/            local WP target list (site URLs + descriptions)
#   .elconv-snapshots/   pre-deploy page snapshots (~0.3 MB per run, post-id keyed)
#   qa-output/           elconv qa captures + diff reports (~8 MB of PNGs per run)
#   qa-output-*/         same, from a --output run under another name
#   .elconv-wizard-*     wizard resume state, points at absolute local paths
#   .commandcode/        editor scratch file
#   FramerSites/         downloaded Framer exports (~3 MB, reproducible)
#
# Snapshots and exports are reproducible outputs; the wizard state and target
# list describe one machine and one site. Neither belongs in a shared history.
.elconv/
.elconv-snapshots/
qa-output/
qa-output-*/
.elconv-wizard-state.json
.elconv-wizard-state.json.contract.json
.elconv-wizard-v3-tables.json
.elconv-wizard-v3-tables.json.contract.json
.commandcode/
FramerSites/
